# Event-illustration working directory: the prompt sheet, the 1376x768 source
# plates and the greyscale previews (~20MB). tools/gen_event_art.py bakes them
# into src/event_art_data.h, and THAT is what ships — nothing at runtime reads
# the originals, so they stay out of the repo.
docs/event-art/
docs/event-art-prompts.html

# Combat-portrait working directory: the source drawings and the greyscale
# previews. tools/gen_enemy_art.py bakes them into src/enemy_art_data.h (and
# synthesises a placeholder for any subject whose source is still missing), and
# THAT is what ships — nothing at runtime reads the originals.
docs/enemy-art/
